OL,3,AMinimum wage set to rise but 18-20
OL,4,Ayear-olds will not get bigger increase
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe rise in the minimum wage is
OL,7,Fexpected to be announced in the Budget,
OL,8,Fbut 18-to-20 year-olds are set to see
OL,9,Flower increases than in previous years,
OL,10,Fthe BBC understands.
OL,12,FPay for younger workers will rise in
OL,13,Fline with the increase in minimum pay
OL,14,Ffor employees aged 21 years and over.
OL,16,FHowever, the increase for younger
OL,17,Fworkers is lower than that seen in the
OL,18,Fprevious two years, when Labour raised
OL,19,Fthe rate to meet a manifesto promise
OL,20,Fthat it would remove "discriminatory
OL,21,Fage bands" with all adults entitled to
OL,22,Fthe same minimum wage.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
